sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Agent as Agent Orchestrator
    participant Router as Tool Router
    participant Verify as Identity and Permission Checks
    participant Confirm as Confirmation Manager
    participant Banking as Banking API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Audit as Audit Logging
    participant Handoff as Human Handoff

    Customer->>Agent: Report an unauthorized, failed, or duplicate transaction
    Agent->>Agent: Clarify the issue and collect only required details
    Agent->>Router: Propose transaction-status lookup
    Router->>Verify: Authorize lookup for trusted customer context
    alt Lookup is not authorized
        Verify-->>Router: Deny
        Router->>Audit: Log denied tool call with redacted inputs
        Router-->>Agent: Authorization failure
        Agent-->>Customer: Explain limitation or offer human support
    else Lookup is authorized
        Verify-->>Router: Permit
        Router->>Banking: Get transaction status using trusted identity and reference
        Banking->>DB: Read authorized transaction record
        DB-->>Banking: Status, matching record, or not found
        Banking-->>Router: Structured lookup result
        Router->>Audit: Log tool call and result status
        Router-->>Agent: Transaction status

        alt Transaction cannot be found or evidence is insufficient
            Agent-->>Customer: Explain that status cannot be confirmed; do not guess
            opt Customer needs further investigation
                Agent->>Handoff: Request human review with concise summary
                Handoff->>Audit: Record handoff event
                Handoff-->>Agent: Handoff status/reference
                Agent-->>Customer: Provide handoff status or reference
            end
        else Transaction appears failed, pending, or duplicated
            Agent->>Agent: Explain observed status and applicable policy evidence
            Agent-->>Customer: Summarize issue and propose opening a dispute
            Agent->>Router: Prepare open_dispute proposal with transaction reference and issue details
            Router->>Verify: Validate trusted identity, permissions, and required verification

            alt Authorization or validation fails
                Verify-->>Router: Deny or return validation errors
                Router->>Audit: Record denied/invalid dispute proposal
                Router-->>Agent: No pending action created
                Agent-->>Customer: Explain limitation or request missing information
            else Authorization and validation succeed
                Verify-->>Router: Permit
                Router->>Confirm: Persist pending dispute action bound to customer/session and exact details
                Confirm->>DB: Store pending action, expiry, and stable idempotency key
                DB-->>Confirm: Persisted confirmation_id
                Confirm-->>Router: confirmation_id and exact action summary
                Router->>Audit: Record pending action creation
                Router-->>Agent: Pending dispute; not executed
                Agent-->>Customer: Show dispute summary and confirmation_id; ask for explicit approval
                Customer->>Agent: Approve or decline the identified pending dispute

                alt Customer declines or does not clearly approve
                    Agent->>Confirm: Resolve pending action as declined or leave pending if ambiguous
                    Confirm->>DB: Persist decline when explicit; otherwise preserve pending state
                    Agent->>Audit: Record decline/ambiguous response; no execution
                    Agent-->>Customer: Confirm no dispute was created, or ask for clear confirmation
                else Customer explicitly approves
                    Agent->>Router: Submit confirmation_id with trusted session context
                    Router->>Verify: Recheck current identity, verification, and permissions
                    Verify-->>Router: Permit or deny

                    alt Current authorization fails
                        Router->>Confirm: Do not consume for execution; reject approval
                        Router->>Audit: Record authorization failure
                        Router-->>Agent: No dispute created
                        Agent-->>Customer: Explain limitation or offer human support
                    else Current authorization succeeds
                        Router->>Confirm: Validate action match, expiry, binding, and unused state; atomically consume
                        Confirm->>DB: Atomically transition pending action to execution-in-progress
                        DB-->>Confirm: Valid one-time approval or invalid/expired/used
                        alt Confirmation invalid, expired, or already used
                            Confirm-->>Router: Reject execution
                            Router->>Audit: Record confirmation failure
                            Router-->>Agent: No dispute created
                            Agent-->>Customer: Request a fresh dispute proposal/confirmation if appropriate
                        else Confirmation valid
                            Confirm-->>Router: One-time approval and stable idempotency key
                            Router->>Banking: Open dispute with idempotency key and trusted identity
                            Banking->>DB: Create dispute and audit data transactionally
                            alt Dispute created
                                DB-->>Banking: Commit dispute reference
                                Banking-->>Router: Success with dispute reference
                                Router->>Audit: Record successful tool call
                                Router-->>Agent: Dispute reference and status
                                Agent-->>Customer: Confirm dispute creation and provide reference
                            else Creation rejected
                                DB-->>Banking: No successful dispute creation
                                Banking-->>Router: Explicit failure
                                Router->>Audit: Record failure
                                Router-->>Agent: Failure details
                                Agent-->>Customer: Explain failure without claiming a dispute exists
                            else Outcome is unknown
                                Banking-->>Router: Unresolved outcome
                                Note over Banking,DB: Reconcile using the idempotency key or operation reference before retrying or claiming the dispute was or was not created.
                                Router->>Audit: Record unresolved outcome
                                Router-->>Agent: Outcome unresolved
                                Agent->>Handoff: Request investigation if needed
                                Handoff-->>Agent: Handoff status/reference
                                Agent-->>Customer: Explain that creation is unconfirmed and provide the next step
                            end
                        end
                    end
                end
            end
        else Transaction is confirmed successful and no duplicate evidence is found
            Agent-->>Customer: Explain the verified status and relevant policy; do not promise a reversal
        end
    end

    Note over Agent,DB: The pending action and confirmation_id must be persisted and shown before approval is requested. Customer confirmation is required before opening a dispute; backend authorization and confirmation checks are authoritative.
    Note over Confirm,DB: Confirmation is bound to the exact proposed action, expires, is single-use, and is audited.
    Note over Audit: Log every tool call with tool name, redacted inputs, result/status, and correlation context.
